OL,3,GNEWSAJohn McGuinness' 30-year TT career
OL,4,Acelebrated
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaking his debut in 1996, he took his
OL,7,Ffirst win three years later, going on
OL,8,Fto record a tally of 23 victories -
OL,9,Fbecoming the first rider to complete a
OL,10,F130mph (209km/h) lap of the course
OL,11,Falong the way.
